# Snyk policy: findings accepted on purpose, each with its reason and an expiry date, after
# which Snyk reports them again. Accepting one is a security decision for a human maintainer
# (docs/SECURITY_REVIEW.md, "Accepted findings").
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed version of braces exists. It is only reached through tailwindcss 3 (chokidar,
          micromatch) while building the site, on file patterns written in this repository, so no
          attacker can supply input to it. It is not in the browser bundle or in either Docker
          image. Revisit when braces publishes a fix or the site moves to Tailwind 4.
        expires: 2026-12-13T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-13T23:30:00.000Z
patch: {}
